---
import LiveCard from "../components/LiveCard.astro";
import PNotes from "../components/PNotes.astro";
---

<p-slide class="cover-internal center">
  <h2 class="main-gradient">One component. All talk.</h2>
  <p
    p-effect="from below"
    style="font-size: 0.75em; opacity: 0.8; margin-block-start: 1em;"
  >
    We'll build this - layer by layer - in the browser.
  </p>

  <PNotes>
    <p>From here on, every feature we see gets added to this one card.</p>
    <p>
      By the end we'll have a working design system: theming, dark mode,
      context-aware layout - all computed by the browser from a handful of
      tokens.
    </p>
    <p>Not isolated examples: a system being assembled live.</p>
  </PNotes>
</p-slide>

<p-slide>
  <h5 style="margin-block-end: 1em" class="center">
    <span class="main-gradient">Layer 0</span> - just markup, no CSS yet
  </h5>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: stretch;">
    <div
      style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"
      p-effect="from left"
    >
      <pre style="flex: 1;" class="small-line" data-label-file="card.html">
            <code style="font-size: 0.65em;" is:raw class="language-scss">
    &lt;section&gt;
      &lt;article&gt;
        &lt;img src="cover.jpg" alt="" /&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
          &lt;h3&gt;Card title&lt;/h3&gt;
          &lt;p&gt;Card description&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
          &lt;h3&gt;Text-only card&lt;/h3&gt;
          &lt;p&gt;No image&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;</code>
      </pre>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; align-self: center;" p-effect="from right">
      <LiveCard stage="markup" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <PNotes>
    <p>This is the starting point - just HTML. No styles, no build step.</p>
    <p>
      The card on the right is rendered live - raw, unstyled. Each section adds
      one layer to it.
    </p>
    <p>
      At the end of each section we'll see the CSS accumulate. At the end we'll
      see it running live in the browser.
    </p>
  </PNotes>
</p-slide>
